2660..2735 Comment "/// Put-get, put-put and get-get together, the laws a state-passing handler"
2736..2812 Comment "/// is checked against (`../specification/state-wp.gandr`). A read of a read"
2813..2891 Comment "/// under a store is a redex of put-get and of get-get, and both reducts store"
2892..2969 Comment "/// the value and continue at it twice. Get-put beside them is refused in the"
2970..2987 Comment "/// twin (#1934)."
